# "At the beginning of your upkeep, exile the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of card types among other
# nonland permanents you control. You may play those cards this turn." Bot1 casts Loot (a creature) on turn 1 with three Moxen
# (artifacts). Bot2 casts a Grizzly Bears on turn 2: not Bot1's permanent, so its type isn't counted. On turn 3 the upkeep
# trigger counts one type (artifact; "other" leaves out Loot's own creature type), so it exiles the top card (a Lightning Bolt),
# not the Island under it, which Bot1 then draws. Bot1 casts the Bolt from exile this turn.

